{"id":1761,"date":"2026-08-24T16:07:58","date_gmt":"2026-08-24T16:07:58","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1761"},"modified":"2026-08-25T17:30:52","modified_gmt":"2026-08-25T17:30:52","slug":"the-document-inspector","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/security-privacy\/the-document-inspector\/","title":{"rendered":"The Document Inspector"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">The Document Inspector<\/span><\/h2>\n<h2 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1774\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDocumentInspector.webp\" alt=\"The Document Inspector\" width=\"102\" height=\"106\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDocumentInspector.webp 942w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDocumentInspector-290x300.webp 290w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDocumentInspector-768x794.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 102px) 100vw, 102px\" \/><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Before you share, publish, or hand off a document, it is important to know exactly what is inside it. Open Publisher files can silently accumulate hidden metadata, stray off-canvas objects, and invisible text boxes that you may not want recipients to see &#8211; the <strong>Document Inspector<\/strong> is a privacy and security tool that finds and removes all of it in one place, before the file leaves your hands.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Opening the Document Inspector<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1771\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/OpeningTHeDocumentInspector.webp\" alt=\"Opening the Document Inspector\" width=\"372\" height=\"113\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/OpeningTHeDocumentInspector.webp 1195w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/OpeningTHeDocumentInspector-300x91.webp 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/OpeningTHeDocumentInspector-1024x311.webp 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/OpeningTHeDocumentInspector-768x233.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 372px) 100vw, 372px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Go to <strong>File &gt; Info &gt; Inspect Document<\/strong>. The Inspector immediately scans your entire document across all pages and presents its findings.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">What the Inspector Checks<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1769\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WhatTheInspectorChecksFor.webp\" alt=\"What the Inspector Checks\" width=\"171\" height=\"175\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WhatTheInspectorChecksFor.webp 440w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WhatTheInspectorChecksFor-293x300.webp 293w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 171px) 100vw, 171px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The Inspector scans three categories of potentially sensitive or unwanted content:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Document Properties &#8211;<\/strong> Checks for embedded metadata such as Author, Company, Subject, and Keywords. This metadata is invisible in the design but travels with the file &#8211; useful to strip before sharing externally so personal or company information is not unintentionally exposed.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Off-Canvas Elements &#8211;<\/strong> Detects elements that exist completely outside the page boundary &#8211; stored in the Scratch Area or accidentally dragged off-page. These objects are invisible in your printed or exported output but are still present inside the file and visible to anyone who opens it in Open Publisher.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Empty Text Boxes &#8211;<\/strong> Flags text boxes containing only whitespace or invisible HTML entities such as <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">&amp;nbsp;<\/span>. These are easy to leave behind and can bloat file size or expose placeholder content.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Status Badges &amp; Removing Data<\/span><\/h3>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1765\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-24-170819.png\" alt=\"Status Badges &amp; Removing Data\" width=\"401\" height=\"267\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-24-170819.png 896w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-24-170819-300x200.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-24-170819-768x512.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 401px) 100vw, 401px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Each category displays a colour-coded status badge:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Found &#8211;<\/strong> Data was detected and requires your attention.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Clean &#8211;<\/strong> Nothing to report in this category.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"western\">A one-click <strong>Remove All<\/strong> button is provided for each category, allowing you to instantly purge the detected data without having to locate and delete items manually. Running the Inspector before every export or file handoff is a good habit for keeping your documents clean and your sensitive information private.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The Document Inspector Before you share, publish, or hand off a document, it is important to know exactly what is inside it. Open Publisher files can silently accumulate hidden metadata, stray off-canvas objects, and invisible text boxes that you may not want recipients to see &#8211; the Document Inspector is a privacy and security tool [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1774,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[22],"class_list":["post-1761","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-security-privacy"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1761","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1761"}],"version-history":[{"count":10,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1761\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1779,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1761\/revisions\/1779"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1774"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1761"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1761"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}